    "turn_text": "I mentioned Pittsburgh, a whole bunch over the years. My friend Selena Zito is probably the best reporter in the Commonwealth of Pennsylvania. She was just at a steel plant there. She's at a place that does fracking today. She's been going all around the state and seeing how industry is so excited about Trump's policies because they know a lot of investment is coming into the state that's going to create high paying career jobs.",
